
<header class="bio-intro">
  <p class="lead">Follow Jackie’s life in this pastiche<sup>*</sup>, through memories from his columns and blog posts,
  interwoven with imagined scenes and conversations. His own writing can be read in
  <a href="{{(url "pool")}}">The Deep Pool</a>; excerpts also accompany the
  <a href="{{(url "zeitreise")}}">timeline</a>. If you can add a memory or a missing detail,
  <a href="mailto:stefan@jackieleven.com">please get in touch</a>.</p>

  <p class="worterklaerung"><sup>*</sup> A literary work deliberately written in the style of another author.</p>
</header>
